{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.natsuha.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "练习室里有人在喊拍子",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.natsuha.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.natsuha.first",
    "idolId": "natsuha",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "一、二、三、四！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……好热烈的气氛。打扰也不好，就在这儿等着吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "你就是我的制作人吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，你是——",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "听好？目标是顶点，只有顶点哦！",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……诶、那、那个？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "哎呀，发什么呆呢？理所当然的吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "偶像也好什么也好，目标不可能是世界第一以外的！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "你既然是我的制作人，就给我这么打算着！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……明白了。那为了这个，我们一起来想该做什么吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "不，那没必要。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "什么意思？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "偶像的制作，也许你经验更多一点。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "但说到有栖川夏葉的制作，只是我经验更长而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "所以你什么都不用想，全部交给我。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "唔……总不能真的那样，不过你的意见我会尽量采纳。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "还有，你要以『放課後クライマックスガールズ』这个五人组合活动。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "也没什么不好哦。单人也好组合也好，我要冲向顶点这一点不会变。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。那今后就拜托了。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "natsuha",
        "text": "嗯，好好跟着我来吧，制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……本来想着是位清纯的大小姐，原来是个相当有主见的女孩子啊。）"
      }
    }
  },
